Subject: [PATCH 07730/11362] [outer-loop] ARC CHAIN PROVEN: autonomous
 perception verifier reproduces tu93 L3 solve (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5837)

The autonomous perception layer derives tu93's (player=9, goal=14) from motion alone
-- identical to the hand-RE'd pair, never hardcoded/from-source. Fed as the verifier
into Carnot's OfflineSolver verifier-routed search, it REPRODUCES the same solve as the
hand verifier: reached L3, reproduction gate PASSED, 47-move path, identical both arms.

First actual discovery of the whole thread: the perception fix that nulled on
greedy-direct and the E3 novelty-explorer WORKS when it feeds the proper verifier-routed
search. Method validation (not a new solve claim; tu93 L3 already in registry;
solve_provenance=development_proxy). Chain closed: perception -> verifier-routed search
-> reproduced discovery.

